{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C1\", \"C4\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C4\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C4\", \"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C4\", \"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"总排序：C1最均衡，既保留了退回安宁不能改变阻碍、带着牵挂行动反而靠近旧愿的因果，也接上了快乐重现、结果无把握和未来可能再退；C4的两种心意并行写得更鲜明，但缺少怀疑与疲惫之后快乐重新出现的过程，且步骤稍多。keep：C1覆盖面最大，尤其保留了旧愿与行动关系的转变、对方法而非单纯付出多少的警觉，以及快乐仍在而生活尚未回来；C4补足了责任与依恋共同推动他、愿意吃苦却不愿耗尽温柔；C2比C3更明确地写出快乐未必持续、努力能否改变障碍。cover：C4最能解释柔软与力量为何能够同时存在、为何高涨之后又会顾虑代价并松下来；C1次之，尤其把怀疑疲惫后的快乐和未竟感接得完整。lean：C2最紧凑，因果推进清楚；C1把快乐、生活尚未实现和保护多少无把握压在同一条里，C3的顾虑分成了较多步骤，C4则把快乐回返拆成两条，略显重复。plain：C4的肩上有事还惦记、愿意吃苦、会不会把温柔搭进去，最像一个人在讲自己的难处；C1也具体自然，C2稍偏解释，C3的刚找回的温柔等表达略显概括。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "897495fb-edc7-4089-b59a-628898810cef", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T013027437330Z", "elapsed_seconds": 94.907, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:32:02.356141+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6877dbcbc4a49fb7eae0c5b944075a12f78856029af309a868e35bf4f5681e48", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "atta